[[File:Keris partisan of amascut detail.png|130px|left]]
The '''keris partisan of Amascut''' is a one-handed spear requiring [[Attack]] level 80 to wield. It is created by combining a [[jewel of Amascut]] with a [[keris partisan]]. The upgrade greatly enhances the weapon's stats when used inside the [[Tombs of Amascut]]. If fighting [[Kalphite_(attribute)|kalphites or scabarites]], this variant has a damage bonus of 15%, down from the base weapon's 33%. It retains the 1/51 chance to deal triple damage against these targets, however. 

The upgrade increases the [[stab bonus]] and [[strength bonus]] to +108 and +67, respectively (up from +58 and +45). This combination makes the weapon more suitable for general use in the raid, allowing it to be effective against a wide array of enemies. This makes it a possible choice for a primary weapon, with its effectiveness surpassing the [[Zamorakian hasta]] for this purpose. The Keris partisan of Amascut is particularly useful for players who have not yet obtained [[Osmumten's fang]], including [[Ironman Mode|Ironmen]]. It isn't ideal for higher invocations, however.

As with other variants, [[weapon poison|weapon poisons]] cannot be applied to the keris partisan of Amascut.

